[Eb]Take it [Bb]to the Lord in [F]prayer.
[Bb]In His arms He'll take and [Eb]shield thee,
[Bb]Thou wilt [F]find a solace [Bb]there.

{comment: Verse 4}
[Bb]Blessed Savior, Thou hast [Eb]promised
[Bb]Thou wilt all our burdens [F]bear;
[Bb]May we ever, Lord, be [Eb]bringing
